@startuml
!include style.puml
title Decorator: optional drawing layers
abstract class Graphic {
  + draw(bounds)
  + setRenderer(renderer)
}
abstract class GraphicDecorator {
  # wrapped: Graphic
  + draw(bounds)
  + setRenderer(renderer)
  # drawLayer(bounds)
}
class OutlineDecorator
class HealthBarDecorator
interface HealthView {
  + currentHealth()
  + maxHealth()
}
class GraphicLayers {
  + {static} compose(base, health, outline, healthBar, settings)
}
Graphic <|-- GraphicDecorator
GraphicDecorator o--> Graphic : wraps
GraphicDecorator <|-- OutlineDecorator
GraphicDecorator <|-- HealthBarDecorator
HealthBarDecorator --> HealthView : reads live health
GraphicLayers ..> OutlineDecorator
GraphicLayers ..> HealthBarDecorator
note bottom of GraphicLayers
Always rebuild from the undecorated base.
Renderer changes propagate through the chain.
end note
@enduml
